flowchart TB
    Identity[Session or scoped API key] --> API[API: current rights and workspace]
    API --> DB[PostgreSQL: RLS + queue]
    API --> Connections[Scoped connections]
    Connections --> Prep[Git: addresses, disk, SHA]
    DB --> Controller[Controller: leases + limits]
    Prep --> Source[Sources for one job only]
    subgraph Sandbox[Isolated job execution environment]
        Input[SHA checkout and private JSON] --> Typst[Typst: isolated process]
        Packages[Pinned packages and fonts] --> Typst
        Typst --> Output[PDF and bounded diagnostics]
    end
    Source --> Input
    Controller -->|Start and stop| Typst
    Output --> Controller
    Controller --> Artifacts[Private job storage]
    Artifacts --> Download[Authorized download]
    API --> Download
    classDef component fill:#FFE86D,stroke:#A28E26,color:#574900
    class Identity,API,DB,Connections,Prep,Controller,Source,Input,Typst,Packages,Output,Artifacts,Download component
    style Sandbox fill:#edf6ff,stroke:#a0c4fb,color:#1a1a1a
